:: Night event - moonlit cache
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHT</h1>
<br /><br />
<<set _nightBack = setup.night.backPassage()>>
<center>
	<<image 'places/explore/night_moonlit_cache.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
You would never have seen it with a light. It was only because your eyes had adjusted to the dark that you caught the glint: moonlight on a straight metal edge, poking out of the dirt at the corner of a ruined field.
<br /><br />
You dug it out with your hands. It was an old supply crate, sealed and heavy, buried by someone who had meant to come back for it and never had.
<br /><br />
<<set _mcFound = setup.night.loot('cache', 3)>>
Inside, wrapped in oilcloth, you found <strong><<= _mcFound>></strong>.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Head back'>>
	<<goto _nightBack>>
<</link>>
